  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      The real choice for most engineering-track students weighing this is not "biomedical vs
      biotechnology." It is closer to "biomedical vs a bigger core branch with a device-specialisation
      added later." Both routes can lead to the same medtech job in some cases — the difference is how
      directly the degree points there, and how much campus placement support you get on the way.
    </p>
  </div>

